notes.notes:
A small update, in addition to the previously released big update.

[list]
[*] changed the start screen;
[*] player health is now saved when switching from level to level and when loading the game;
[*] fixed the problem of resetting settings on some systems, now all settings are saved as expected;
[*] when moving from level to level, the player's weapon no longer gets stuck in the walls;
[*] cosmetic changes at the levels;
[*] minor fixes and improvements.
[/list]
